In article <1992Apr3.180552.14220@pellns.alleg.edu> test writes:
>Can anybody out there tell me ways to get rid of cursed objects?  I'm a  
>barbarian stuck with enough cursed armor to make my AC as poor as if I  
>weren't wearing any armor at all, and I have crystal plate mail that I want  
>to put on.

Hm let me think, there are (as with everything) lots of ways to do this,
read destroy armor, or let a nymph steal it. You can remove cursed boots
by levitating, and then flying over a sink, which will remove your boots
(how the h*ll did they invent THAT ??), I believe eating salmon from a tin
will make your hands slippery, and remove a cursed weapon (but will leave
cursed rings on, unfortunately). Also, try rusting it, with water or a
rust monster till it becomes -6, hopefully it'll crumble away after that.
Finally, you can remove the curse itself, by praying, reading 'remove curse',
dipping it into a fountain (this works even if you're wearing the armor),
and finally dipping in holy water. Good luck !

